  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/636/armor-stand-arms-header.png\" width=\"1857\" height=\"140\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>简介</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">得益于轻松快速地为所有盔甲架添加手臂的功能，您的原版游戏体验将得到进一步提升。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只需靠近你已放置的盔甲架，然后输入命令 <em><strong>/trigger armorstandarms</strong></em>&nbsp; 即可为你生成手臂。请确保你与盔甲架的距离在 3 格以内。&nbsp; <em>此功能在服务端运行，在服务器游玩时客户端无需安装。</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/637/armor-stand-arms-screenshot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"><br></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就购买服务器，与好友一起畅玩！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a> 或下方横幅，并使用代码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
